{"status": "ok", "language": "zh-Hant", "cues": [{"t": 0.3, "d": 1.7, "text": "嗨，大家好"}, {"t": 2.0, "d": 2.47, "text": "欢迎回到我的频道"}, {"t": 4.63, "d": 1.57, "text": "我是安吉拉"}, {"t": 6.6, "d": 1.63, "text": "好久不见了"}, {"t": 8.5, "d": 4.4, "text": "我最近一直都没有更新视频"}, {"t": 13.4, "d": 3.33, "text": "因为我感冒一直都没有好"}, {"t": 17.13, "d": 3.27, "text": "前两天又有点儿严重了"}, {"t": 20.83, "d": 1.77, "text": "一直在咳嗽"}, {"t": 22.7, "d": 1.7, "text": "咳嗽得很厉害"}, {"t": 24.8, "d": 2.27, "text": "所以没有更新视频"}, {"t": 27.6, "d": 1.8, "text": "今天好一些了"}, {"t": 29.53, "d": 1.5, "text": "我又回来了"}, {"t": 31.2, "d": 2.57, "text": "继续和大家聊天儿"}, {"t": 33.93, "d": 4.53, "text": "今天想跟大家聊的话题是“短视频”"}, {"t": 39.03, "d": 3.7, "text": "大家平时会刷短视频吗"}, {"t": 43.13, "d": 2.57, "text": "用手机刷短视频"}, {"t": 45.83, "d": 1.47, "text": "看短视频"}, {"t": 48.6, "d": 1.43, "text": "那在中国呢"}, {"t": 50.03, "d": 4.57, "text": "很多中国人都非常喜欢刷短视频"}, {"t": 55.03, "d": 4.07, "text": "在中国也有很多短视频的APP"}, {"t": 59.73, "d": 2.2, "text": "其中最火的"}, {"t": 62.33, "d": 3.27, "text": "用的人最多的就是抖音"}, {"t": 66.13, "d": 3.67, "text": "抖音在其他的国家好像也可以用吧"}, {"t": 70.1, "d": 1.97, "text": "但是只是在中国"}, {"t": 72.23, "d": 5.3, "text": "每天就有8亿的人在用抖音刷短视频"}, {"t": 78.0, "d": 1.67, "text": "并且这些人"}, {"t": 79.67, "d": 4.63, "text": "每天用抖音刷短视频的平均时间"}, {"t": 84.6, "d": 2.73, "text": "每个人是一个半小时"}, {"t": 87.73, "d": 1.33, "text": "可以看到"}, {"t": 89.07, "d": 3.33, "text": "中国人是多么喜欢刷短视频了"}, {"t": 92.47, "d": 3.53, "text": "我今天为什么想聊这个话题呢"}, {"t": 96.3, "d": 1.1, "text": "因为我发现"}, {"t": 97.4, "d": 4.93, "text": "我最近对刷短视频有点儿上瘾了"}, {"t": 102.33, "d": 4.8, "text": "上瘾的意思就是你总是想做一件事情"}, {"t": 107.53, "d": 1.7, "text": "控制不住自己"}, {"t": 109.33, "d": 2.7, "text": "想停下来却停不下来"}, {"t": 112.4, "d": 2.03, "text": "这就叫上瘾了"}, {"t": 114.43, "d": 2.47, "text": "有的人会对抽烟上瘾"}, {"t": 117.33, "d": 2.13, "text": "有的人会对喝酒上瘾"}, {"t": 119.9, "d": 3.53, "text": "我现在对刷短视频上瘾了"}, {"t": 123.5, "d": 1.5, "text": "只要有时间"}, {"t": 125.0, "d": 3.2, "text": "我就想打开手机刷短视频"}, {"t": 128.73, "d": 2.7, "text": "吃饭的时候会刷短视频"}, {"t": 132.03, "d": 1.57, "text": "睡觉之前"}, {"t": 133.8, "d": 4.6, "text": "躺在床上舒舒服服的，想刷短视频"}, {"t": 138.73, "d": 1.97, "text": "还有最可怕的是"}, {"t": 140.83, "d": 3.0, "text": "每天早上一睁开眼睛"}, {"t": 143.9, "d": 3.53, "text": "我就想打开手机刷一会儿短视频"}, {"t": 148.43, "d": 3.67, "text": "其实如果只刷一会儿短视频"}, {"t": 152.1, "d": 1.3, "text": "放松一下"}, {"t": 153.4, "d": 1.93, "text": "我觉得是没有问题的"}, {"t": 155.83, "d": 1.97, "text": "那我现在的问题是"}, {"t": 157.83, "d": 2.5, "text": "明明我只想看一会儿"}, {"t": 160.67, "d": 7.2, "text": "但是我经常看着看着，就看了一个小时、两个小时"}, {"t": 168.03, "d": 1.2, "text": "那这种感觉呢"}, {"t": 169.23, "d": 1.63, "text": "让我很不舒服"}, {"t": 171.13, "d": 2.4, "text": "让我有一种负罪感"}, {"t": 174.03, "d": 4.27, "text": "我觉得我现在每天花太多的时间"}, {"t": 178.3, "d": 2.8, "text": "在一些没有用的事情上"}, {"t": 181.33, "d": 2.4, "text": "让我感觉有一些负罪感"}, {"t": 183.93, "d": 1.47, "text": "有一些焦虑"}, {"t": 185.7, "d": 4.23, "text": "我想戒掉刷短视频这个习惯"}, {"t": 190.4, "d": 3.47, "text": "为了解决最近困扰我的这个问题"}, {"t": 193.9, "d": 3.03, "text": "我特意问了一下AI"}, {"t": 197.33, "d": 1.33, "text": "问了一下他"}, {"t": 198.67, "d": 3.57, "text": "为什么我会对刷短视频上瘾？"}, {"t": 202.6, "d": 2.83, "text": "我怎么才能戒掉短视频？"}, {"t": 205.8, "d": 2.5, "text": "今天我就跟大家分享一下"}, {"t": 208.4, "d": 2.23, "text": "AI是怎么回答我的"}, {"t": 210.73, "d": 1.9, "text": "它都跟我说了什么"}, {"t": 212.73, "d": 2.5, "text": "在回答我的问题之前呢"}, {"t": 215.23, "d": 1.7, "text": "AI很贴心"}, {"t": 217.03, "d": 1.7, "text": "它先安慰了我"}, {"t": 218.93, "d": 0.97, "text": "它跟我说"}, {"t": 219.9, "d": 4.23, "text": "对短视频上瘾不是我自己的问题"}, {"t": 224.23, "d": 2.43, "text": "不是因为我不够自律"}, {"t": 226.87, "d": 1.87, "text": "让我不要有负罪感"}, {"t": 229.3, "d": 1.8, "text": "对短视频上瘾呢"}, {"t": 231.1, "d": 4.0, "text": "是大脑、心情、还有软件"}, {"t": 235.13, "d": 3.9, "text": "这三个东西一起作用的结果"}, {"t": 239.23, "d": 1.2, "text": "它跟我说"}, {"t": 240.47, "d": 3.13, "text": "每个人都会遇到这样的问题"}, {"t": 243.63, "d": 1.83, "text": "先让我放轻松"}, {"t": 245.47, "d": 1.8, "text": "不要有负罪感"}, {"t": 247.73, "d": 2.33, "text": "接下来它就告诉了我"}, {"t": 250.07, "d": 3.97, "text": "人们会对短视频上瘾的三个原因"}, {"t": 254.27, "d": 3.33, "text": "第一个原因是我们大脑的原因"}, {"t": 258.03, "d": 4.7, "text": "它说我们的大脑喜欢简单、快速的快乐"}, {"t": 263.47, "d": 5.27, "text": "比如说我们如果学习、看书或者运动的时候"}, {"t": 268.83, "d": 2.5, "text": "快乐来的是很慢的"}, {"t": 272.03, "d": 2.63, "text": "我们在学习看书的时候"}, {"t": 274.73, "d": 2.4, "text": "通常要看很长时间"}, {"t": 277.13, "d": 1.53, "text": "还要思考"}, {"t": 278.83, "d": 2.6, "text": "才会学会新的知识"}, {"t": 281.5, "d": 1.5, "text": "才有成就感"}, {"t": 283.6, "d": 1.87, "text": "运动也是一样的"}, {"t": 285.63, "d": 2.97, "text": "比如说我们跑步、健身的时候"}, {"t": 288.7, "d": 2.63, "text": "也要经过很长时间"}, {"t": 291.47, "d": 1.43, "text": "流很多汗"}, {"t": 293.0, "d": 1.3, "text": "很累之后"}, {"t": 294.3, "d": 5.77, "text": "才会获得运动之后的那种放松啊、还有舒服"}, {"t": 300.5, "d": 2.33, "text": "但是短视频就不一样了"}, {"t": 303.03, "d": 3.03, "text": "每个短视频时间都很短"}, {"t": 306.2, "d": 4.93, "text": "只有十几秒、几十秒或者一分钟的时间"}, {"t": 311.8, "d": 1.9, "text": "那这些短视频呢"}, {"t": 313.7, "d": 3.8, "text": "能够很快让我们变得很开心"}, {"t": 317.67, "d": 1.4, "text": "变得很刺激"}, {"t": 319.27, "d": 2.97, "text": "或者一下子变得心情很好"}, {"t": 322.27, "d": 2.23, "text": "每看到一条短视频的时候"}, {"t": 324.5, "d": 5.83, "text": "我们的大脑都会很快地分泌一种让人快乐的东西"}, {"t": 330.7, "d": 1.43, "text": "那一条结束之后"}, {"t": 332.13, "d": 2.53, "text": "马上又来了一条新的"}, {"t": 334.83, "d": 3.3, "text": "所以这种快乐是持续不断的"}, {"t": 338.23, "d": 2.0, "text": "会让人停不下来"}, {"t": 340.63, "d": 4.5, "text": "慢慢地，大脑就会习惯这种快速的快乐"}, {"t": 345.33, "d": 2.5, "text": "如果我们再去看书啊"}, {"t": 347.93, "d": 1.37, "text": "写东西啊"}, {"t": 349.3, "d": 2.1, "text": "想安静做事的时候"}, {"t": 351.43, "d": 2.07, "text": "就很难坚持下去"}, {"t": 353.5, "d": 2.9, "text": "会觉得很枯燥、很无聊"}, {"t": 356.4, "d": 2.27, "text": "没办法安静下来"}, {"t": 358.87, "d": 3.73, "text": "这就是为什么我们越刷短视频"}, {"t": 362.67, "d": 3.8, "text": "越难专注地做一件事情的原因"}, {"t": 366.8, "d": 6.27, "text": "第二个原因呢是短视频能够让人的心情变好"}, {"t": 373.2, "d": 1.4, "text": "现在的生活"}, {"t": 374.6, "d": 2.13, "text": "每个人的压力都很大"}, {"t": 377.0, "d": 3.03, "text": "所以每个人都有很累的时候"}, {"t": 380.53, "d": 1.73, "text": "心情不好的时候"}, {"t": 382.27, "d": 2.23, "text": "或者很孤独的时候"}, {"t": 385.1, "d": 1.3, "text": "那在这种时候"}, {"t": 386.4, "d": 2.43, "text": "任何人都需要一种方式"}, {"t": 388.83, "d": 2.2, "text": "能让自己放松下来"}, {"t": 391.07, "d": 2.73, "text": "能让自己的心情变得好一点儿"}, {"t": 394.43, "d": 1.4, "text": "那短视频呢"}, {"t": 395.83, "d": 3.0, "text": "就是最简单的一种方法"}, {"t": 399.1, "d": 1.97, "text": "因为刷短视频"}, {"t": 401.07, "d": 1.63, "text": "你不需要出门"}, {"t": 402.87, "d": 1.83, "text": "也不需要花钱"}, {"t": 404.93, "d": 2.8, "text": "只要打开手机就可以了"}, {"t": 407.83, "d": 2.1, "text": "所以对很多人来说"}, {"t": 409.93, "d": 3.73, "text": "刷短视频不仅是一种娱乐方式"}, {"t": 414.0, "d": 2.63, "text": "也能安慰人的情绪"}, {"t": 416.7, "d": 2.33, "text": "让自己的心情变好"}, {"t": 419.33, "d": 4.4, "text": "所以慢慢地，人们在心情不好的时候"}, {"t": 423.73, "d": 1.47, "text": "无聊的时候"}, {"t": 425.23, "d": 2.5, "text": "就会自然而然地"}, {"t": 427.83, "d": 3.6, "text": "很自然地打开手机刷短视频"}, {"t": 431.6, "d": 3.17, "text": "慢慢地就会形成习惯了"}, {"t": 434.93, "d": 1.27, "text": "第三个原因"}, {"t": 436.2, "d": 2.4, "text": "也是最重要的一个原因"}, {"t": 439.1, "d": 1.9, "text": "短视频的软件"}, {"t": 441.0, "d": 4.2, "text": "就是为了让观众一直不停地看下去"}, {"t": 445.67, "d": 3.03, "text": "因为短视频是没有结尾的"}, {"t": 449.13, "d": 2.53, "text": "我们看书总会看完"}, {"t": 451.93, "d": 1.13, "text": "看电影呢"}, {"t": 453.07, "d": 1.73, "text": "也会有一个结局"}, {"t": 455.1, "d": 3.4, "text": "但是短视频一条结束之后"}, {"t": 458.53, "d": 2.13, "text": "马上会有下一条"}, {"t": 460.9, "d": 4.17, "text": "所以大脑接收不到结束的信号"}, {"t": 465.27, "d": 2.13, "text": "就想一直看下去"}, {"t": 467.73, "d": 1.1, "text": "那另外呢"}, {"t": 468.93, "d": 2.53, "text": "短视频也非常懂我们"}, {"t": 471.6, "d": 3.8, "text": "它会为我们做一个大数据的分析"}, {"t": 475.4, "d": 4.33, "text": "会不停的给我们推送我们爱看的内容"}, {"t": 480.2, "d": 1.43, "text": "都是爱看的内容"}, {"t": 481.63, "d": 2.1, "text": "所以很难停下来"}, {"t": 483.83, "d": 1.37, "text": "除了告诉我"}, {"t": 485.2, "d": 0.6, "text": "人们"}, {"t": 485.8, "d": 4.53, "text": "为什么会对短视频上瘾的原因之外呢"}, {"t": 490.7, "d": 1.73, "text": "AI还告诉了我"}, {"t": 492.43, "d": 4.0, "text": "几个克服短视频上瘾的方法"}, {"t": 496.83, "d": 5.0, "text": "怎么做才能让自己不对短视频上瘾"}, {"t": 502.5, "d": 1.03, "text": "比如说"}, {"t": 503.53, "d": 4.77, "text": "它告诉我，限制刷短视频的时间"}, {"t": 508.7, "d": 0.5, "text": "比如说"}, {"t": 509.2, "d": 5.0, "text": "限制自己每天只能刷10分钟的短视频"}, {"t": 514.43, "d": 2.8, "text": "只能刷20分钟的短视频"}, {"t": 517.43, "d": 3.3, "text": "给自己限制一个严格的时间"}, {"t": 521.27, "d": 1.23, "text": "那第二个呢"}, {"t": 522.5, "d": 2.77, "text": "我觉得也可以尝试一下"}, {"t": 525.43, "d": 1.57, "text": "就是在睡前"}, {"t": 527.0, "d": 3.5, "text": "在睡觉之前把手机关机"}, {"t": 530.73, "d": 3.73, "text": "这样就不会在睡前一直看手机"}, {"t": 534.47, "d": 1.93, "text": "影响睡眠了"}, {"t": 536.43, "d": 1.17, "text": "那还有一个方法"}, {"t": 537.6, "d": 2.93, "text": "我觉得听起来也是挺好的"}, {"t": 540.87, "d": 2.4, "text": "在你想刷短视频的时候"}, {"t": 543.27, "d": 2.63, "text": "转移一下自己的注意力"}, {"t": 546.03, "d": 2.1, "text": "去干点别的事情"}, {"t": 548.2, "d": 3.03, "text": "这些方法我都准备试一下"}, {"t": 551.43, "d": 2.8, "text": "到时候告诉你们有没有效果"}, {"t": 554.87, "d": 5.33, "text": "那大家平时有没有对短视频上瘾的困扰呢"}, {"t": 560.5, "d": 3.27, "text": "你们是怎么解决这个问题的"}, {"t": 564.07, "d": 2.6, "text": "如果你们也有同样的经历"}, {"t": 566.67, "d": 2.07, "text": "和同样的问题"}, {"t": 568.83, "d": 3.5, "text": "欢迎在评论区一起讨论"}, {"t": 572.67, "d": 2.53, "text": "那今天的视频就到这吧"}, {"t": 575.27, "d": 2.6, "text": "非常感谢你们的收看"}, {"t": 577.93, "d": 1.8, "text": "如果你对我的视频"}, {"t": 579.73, "d": 2.07, "text": "对我的频道感兴趣"}, {"t": 581.8, "d": 2.17, "text": "欢迎订阅我的频道"}, {"t": 584.03, "d": 2.47, "text": "好吧咱们今天就到这吧"}, {"t": 586.5, "d": 2.37, "text": "下次再见拜拜"}], "en_cues": [{"t": 0.3, "d": 1.7, "text": "Hi everyone,"}, {"t": 2.0, "d": 2.47, "text": "welcome back to my channel!"}, {"t": 4.63, "d": 1.57, "text": "I'm Angela."}, {"t": 6.6, "d": 1.63, "text": "It's been a while!"}, {"t": 8.5, "d": 4.4, "text": "I haven't updated my videos lately"}, {"t": 13.4, "d": 3.33, "text": "because I had a bad cold that"}, {"t": 17.13, "d": 3.27, "text": "lingered for a couple of days, and it got even worse."}, {"t": 20.83, "d": 1.77, "text": "I was"}, {"t": 22.7, "d": 1.7, "text": "coughing really badly,"}, {"t": 24.8, "d": 2.27, "text": "so I didn't update. I'm"}, {"t": 27.6, "d": 1.8, "text": "feeling a bit better today,"}, {"t": 29.53, "d": 1.5, "text": "so I'm back"}, {"t": 31.2, "d": 2.57, "text": "to chat with you all."}, {"t": 33.93, "d": 4.53, "text": "Today's topic is \"short videos.\""}, {"t": 39.03, "d": 3.7, "text": "Do you usually watch short videos? Do"}, {"t": 43.13, "d": 2.57, "text": "you watch short videos"}, {"t": 45.83, "d": 1.47, "text": "on your phone"}, {"t": 48.6, "d": 1.43, "text": "? In China,"}, {"t": 50.03, "d": 4.57, "text": "many Chinese people love watching short videos."}, {"t": 55.03, "d": 4.07, "text": "There are many short video apps in China"}, {"t": 59.73, "d": 2.2, "text": ", the most popular and widely"}, {"t": 62.33, "d": 3.27, "text": "used being Douyin (TikTok"}, {"t": 66.13, "d": 3.67, "text": "). Douyin seems to work in other countries too"}, {"t": 70.1, "d": 1.97, "text": ", but in China alone"}, {"t": 72.23, "d": 5.3, "text": ", 800 million people use Douyin to watch short videos every day"}, {"t": 78.0, "d": 1.67, "text": ", and these people"}, {"t": 79.67, "d": 4.63, "text": "spend an average of one and a half hours watching short videos"}, {"t": 84.6, "d": 2.73, "text": "each day."}, {"t": 87.73, "d": 1.33, "text": "You can see"}, {"t": 89.07, "d": 3.33, "text": "how much Chinese people love watching short videos."}, {"t": 92.47, "d": 3.53, "text": "The reason I want to talk about this topic today is"}, {"t": 96.3, "d": 1.1, "text": "because I've found"}, {"t": 97.4, "d": 4.93, "text": "myself a little addicted to watching short videos lately."}, {"t": 102.33, "d": 4.8, "text": "Addiction means you always want to... Being unable to control yourself"}, {"t": 107.53, "d": 1.7, "text": "from doing something,"}, {"t": 109.33, "d": 2.7, "text": "wanting to stop but unable to,"}, {"t": 112.4, "d": 2.03, "text": "is called addiction."}, {"t": 114.43, "d": 2.47, "text": "Some people are addicted to smoking,"}, {"t": 117.33, "d": 2.13, "text": "some to drinking,"}, {"t": 119.9, "d": 3.53, "text": "and now I'm addicted to watching short videos."}, {"t": 123.5, "d": 1.5, "text": "Whenever I have time,"}, {"t": 125.0, "d": 3.2, "text": "I want to open my phone and watch short videos."}, {"t": 128.73, "d": 2.7, "text": "I watch short videos while"}, {"t": 132.03, "d": 1.57, "text": "eating, and before"}, {"t": 133.8, "d": 4.6, "text": "going to bed , lying comfortably in bed, I want to watch short videos."}, {"t": 138.73, "d": 1.97, "text": "And the worst part is that"}, {"t": 140.83, "d": 3.0, "text": "every morning, as soon as I open my eyes,"}, {"t": 143.9, "d": 3.53, "text": "I want to open my phone and watch short videos for a while."}, {"t": 148.43, "d": 3.67, "text": "Actually, if I only watch short videos for a short time"}, {"t": 152.1, "d": 1.3, "text": "to relax,"}, {"t": 153.4, "d": 1.93, "text": "I think there's no problem"}, {"t": 155.83, "d": 1.97, "text": ". But my problem is"}, {"t": 157.83, "d": 2.5, "text": "that even though I only want to watch for a short time"}, {"t": 160.67, "d": 7.2, "text": ", I often end up watching for an hour or two."}, {"t": 168.03, "d": 1.2, "text": "This feeling"}, {"t": 169.23, "d": 1.63, "text": "makes me very uncomfortable"}, {"t": 171.13, "d": 2.4, "text": "and gives me a sense of guilt."}, {"t": 174.03, "d": 4.27, "text": "I feel like I'm spending too much time"}, {"t": 178.3, "d": 2.8, "text": "on useless things every day"}, {"t": 181.33, "d": 2.4, "text": ", which makes me feel guilty"}, {"t": 183.93, "d": 1.47, "text": "and anxious."}, {"t": 185.7, "d": 4.23, "text": "I want to break the habit of watching short videos."}, {"t": 190.4, "d": 3.47, "text": "To solve this problem that has been bothering me recently,"}, {"t": 193.9, "d": 3.03, "text": "I specifically asked an AI"}, {"t": 197.33, "d": 1.33, "text": "why"}, {"t": 198.67, "d": 3.57, "text": "I'm addicted to watching short videos and"}, {"t": 202.6, "d": 2.83, "text": "how I can quit."}, {"t": 205.8, "d": 2.5, "text": "Today I'll share with you"}, {"t": 208.4, "d": 2.23, "text": "how the AI ​​answered my"}, {"t": 210.73, "d": 1.9, "text": "question and what it told me."}, {"t": 212.73, "d": 2.5, "text": "Before answering my question, the"}, {"t": 215.23, "d": 1.7, "text": "AI ​​was very considerate"}, {"t": 217.03, "d": 1.7, "text": "and comforted me first."}, {"t": 218.93, "d": 0.97, "text": "It told me that"}, {"t": 219.9, "d": 4.23, "text": "being addicted to short videos wasn't my own problem"}, {"t": 224.23, "d": 2.43, "text": ", not because I lacked self-discipline, and that"}, {"t": 226.87, "d": 1.87, "text": "I shouldn't feel guilty."}, {"t": 229.3, "d": 1.8, "text": "It explained that short video addiction"}, {"t": 231.1, "d": 4.0, "text": "is the result of the brain, mood, and the software"}, {"t": 235.13, "d": 3.9, "text": "working together ."}, {"t": 239.23, "d": 1.2, "text": "It told me that"}, {"t": 240.47, "d": 3.13, "text": "everyone encounters this problem,"}, {"t": 243.63, "d": 1.83, "text": "and to relax"}, {"t": 245.47, "d": 1.8, "text": ", I shouldn't feel guilty."}, {"t": 247.73, "d": 2.33, "text": "Next, it told me"}, {"t": 250.07, "d": 3.97, "text": "three reasons why people become addicted to short videos."}, {"t": 254.27, "d": 3.33, "text": "The first reason is our brain."}, {"t": 258.03, "d": 4.7, "text": "It said that our brain prefers simple, quick pleasure."}, {"t": 263.47, "d": 5.27, "text": "For example, when we study, read, or exercise,"}, {"t": 268.83, "d": 2.5, "text": "the pleasure comes slowly."}, {"t": 272.03, "d": 2.63, "text": "When studying or reading, we"}, {"t": 274.73, "d": 2.4, "text": "usually need to read for a long time"}, {"t": 277.13, "d": 1.53, "text": "and think"}, {"t": 278.83, "d": 2.6, "text": "before we learn new knowledge"}, {"t": 281.5, "d": 1.5, "text": "and feel a sense of accomplishment."}, {"t": 283.6, "d": 1.87, "text": "The same goes for exercise;"}, {"t": 285.63, "d": 2.97, "text": "for example, when we run or work out,"}, {"t": 288.7, "d": 2.63, "text": "we need to go through a long time,"}, {"t": 291.47, "d": 1.43, "text": "sweat a lot, and"}, {"t": 293.0, "d": 1.3, "text": "feel tired before"}, {"t": 294.3, "d": 5.77, "text": "we experience that relaxation and comfort after exercise. However"}, {"t": 300.5, "d": 2.33, "text": ", short videos are different."}, {"t": 303.03, "d": 3.03, "text": "Each short video is very short,"}, {"t": 306.2, "d": 4.93, "text": "only a few seconds, tens of seconds, or a minute long."}, {"t": 311.8, "d": 1.9, "text": "These short videos"}, {"t": 313.7, "d": 3.8, "text": "can quickly make us happy,"}, {"t": 317.67, "d": 1.4, "text": "exciting"}, {"t": 319.27, "d": 2.97, "text": ", or instantly improve our mood."}, {"t": 322.27, "d": 2.23, "text": "Every time we watch a short video,"}, {"t": 324.5, "d": 5.83, "text": "our brain quickly releases something that makes us happy."}, {"t": 330.7, "d": 1.43, "text": "As soon as one ends,"}, {"t": 332.13, "d": 2.53, "text": "a new one comes along"}, {"t": 334.83, "d": 3.3, "text": ", so this happiness is continuous"}, {"t": 338.23, "d": 2.0, "text": "and makes it hard to stop."}, {"t": 340.63, "d": 4.5, "text": "Gradually, the brain gets used to this rapid happiness."}, {"t": 345.33, "d": 2.5, "text": "If we then try to read,"}, {"t": 347.93, "d": 1.37, "text": "write, or"}, {"t": 349.3, "d": 2.1, "text": "do something quietly,"}, {"t": 351.43, "d": 2.07, "text": "it becomes difficult to persevere."}, {"t": 353.5, "d": 2.9, "text": "We feel bored and unable to"}, {"t": 356.4, "d": 2.27, "text": "calm down."}, {"t": 358.87, "d": 3.73, "text": "This is why the more we watch short videos,"}, {"t": 362.67, "d": 3.8, "text": "the harder it is to focus on one thing."}, {"t": 366.8, "d": 6.27, "text": "The second reason is that short videos can improve people's mood."}, {"t": 373.2, "d": 1.4, "text": "In today's life"}, {"t": 374.6, "d": 2.13, "text": ", everyone is under a lot of pressure"}, {"t": 377.0, "d": 3.03, "text": ", so everyone has times when they are tired,"}, {"t": 380.53, "d": 1.73, "text": "in a bad mood"}, {"t": 382.27, "d": 2.23, "text": ", or lonely."}, {"t": 385.1, "d": 1.3, "text": "At these times,"}, {"t": 386.4, "d": 2.43, "text": "everyone needs a way"}, {"t": 388.83, "d": 2.2, "text": "to relax. To"}, {"t": 391.07, "d": 2.73, "text": "improve one's mood,"}, {"t": 394.43, "d": 1.4, "text": "short"}, {"t": 395.83, "d": 3.0, "text": "videos"}, {"t": 399.1, "d": 1.97, "text": "are the simplest method."}, {"t": 401.07, "d": 1.63, "text": "You don't need to go out"}, {"t": 402.87, "d": 1.83, "text": "or spend money; all you need"}, {"t": 404.93, "d": 2.8, "text": "is your phone."}, {"t": 407.83, "d": 2.1, "text": "For many,"}, {"t": 409.93, "d": 3.73, "text": "watching short videos is not only entertainment"}, {"t": 414.0, "d": 2.63, "text": "but also a way to soothe emotions and"}, {"t": 416.7, "d": 2.33, "text": "improve mood."}, {"t": 419.33, "d": 4.4, "text": "So, gradually, when people are in a bad mood or"}, {"t": 423.73, "d": 1.47, "text": "bored,"}, {"t": 425.23, "d": 2.5, "text": "they naturally and naturally"}, {"t": 427.83, "d": 3.6, "text": "open their phones to watch short videos, and"}, {"t": 431.6, "d": 3.17, "text": "it slowly becomes a habit."}, {"t": 434.93, "d": 1.27, "text": "The third"}, {"t": 436.2, "d": 2.4, "text": "and most important reason"}, {"t": 439.1, "d": 1.9, "text": "is that short video apps"}, {"t": 441.0, "d": 4.2, "text": "are designed to keep viewers watching."}, {"t": 445.67, "d": 3.03, "text": "Because short videos have no ending,"}, {"t": 449.13, "d": 2.53, "text": "unlike books and"}, {"t": 451.93, "d": 1.13, "text": "movies which"}, {"t": 453.07, "d": 1.73, "text": "have a conclusion"}, {"t": 455.1, "d": 3.4, "text": ", short videos"}, {"t": 458.53, "d": 2.13, "text": "immediately start new ones"}, {"t": 460.9, "d": 4.17, "text": "after one ends . The brain doesn't receive the signal of an ending, so"}, {"t": 465.27, "d": 2.13, "text": "it wants to keep watching."}, {"t": 467.73, "d": 1.1, "text": "Furthermore,"}, {"t": 468.93, "d": 2.53, "text": "short videos are very intelligent;"}, {"t": 471.6, "d": 3.8, "text": "they perform big data analysis"}, {"t": 475.4, "d": 4.33, "text": "and constantly push content we like. Since it's all"}, {"t": 480.2, "d": 1.43, "text": "content we like"}, {"t": 481.63, "d": 2.1, "text": ", it's hard to stop watching,"}, {"t": 483.83, "d": 1.37, "text": "except for what tells us"}, {"t": 485.2, "d": 0.6, "text": "... Besides explaining why we"}, {"t": 485.8, "d": 4.53, "text": "become addicted to short videos,"}, {"t": 490.7, "d": 1.73, "text": "the AI ​​also told me"}, {"t": 492.43, "d": 4.0, "text": "several ways"}, {"t": 496.83, "d": 5.0, "text": "to overcome this addiction."}, {"t": 502.5, "d": 1.03, "text": "For example"}, {"t": 503.53, "d": 4.77, "text": ", it suggested limiting my screen time"}, {"t": 508.7, "d": 0.5, "text": "to"}, {"t": 509.2, "d": 5.0, "text": "10-20 minutes a day."}, {"t": 514.43, "d": 2.8, "text": "Another method"}, {"t": 517.43, "d": 3.3, "text": "I think is"}, {"t": 521.27, "d": 1.23, "text": "to"}, {"t": 522.5, "d": 2.77, "text": "turn off my phone before bed"}, {"t": 525.43, "d": 1.57, "text": "to avoid"}, {"t": 527.0, "d": 3.5, "text": "disrupting my sleep."}, {"t": 530.73, "d": 3.73, "text": "Yet another method that sounds good is"}, {"t": 534.47, "d": 1.93, "text": "to shift my focus to"}, {"t": 536.43, "d": 1.17, "text": "something else"}, {"t": 537.6, "d": 2.93, "text": "when I"}, {"t": 540.87, "d": 2.4, "text": "feel like watching short videos"}, {"t": 543.27, "d": 2.63, "text": ". I plan to try these methods"}, {"t": 546.03, "d": 2.1, "text": "and"}, {"t": 548.2, "d": 3.03, "text": "let you know if"}, {"t": 551.43, "d": 2.8, "text": "they work"}, {"t": 554.87, "d": 5.33, "text": ". Have you ever struggled with short video addiction? How do you deal"}, {"t": 560.5, "d": 3.27, "text": "with it?"}, {"t": 564.07, "d": 2.6, "text": "If you have similar experiences"}, {"t": 566.67, "d": 2.07, "text": "and problems,"}, {"t": 568.83, "d": 3.5, "text": "feel free to discuss them in the comments"}, {"t": 572.67, "d": 2.53, "text": ". That's all for today's video."}, {"t": 575.27, "d": 2.6, "text": "Thank you very much for watching."}, {"t": 577.93, "d": 1.8, "text": "If you enjoyed my video..."}, {"t": 579.73, "d": 2.07, "text": "If you're interested in my channel,"}, {"t": 581.8, "d": 2.17, "text": "feel free to subscribe!"}, {"t": 584.03, "d": 2.47, "text": "Okay, that's all for today."}, {"t": 586.5, "d": 2.37, "text": "See you next time, bye!"}], "video_id": "gGDVUmEHde8"}